	<title>Ora</title>
    
    <p>
    To convert between time use the <em>in</em> operator.
    </p>
    <example>
    <p>3 ans en oras</p>
    </example>
    <note>
    <p>
    Time conversions must be performed using the keyboard.
    </p>
